<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A1.SS8" title="In Appendix A Experiments ‣ Transition Matching: Scalable and Flexible Generative Modeling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">A.8 </span>Generation process visualization</span></a></li>
